{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Perhaps we fortune tellers have the greatest observation powers of all.": "",
  "Then I shouldn't have underestimated you.": "",
  "Yes. All I have to do is throw them at you, right?": "",
  "Yeah, that's all there is to it.": "",
  "Er... No, no, no! You throw them at the board, not me!": "",
  "Relax! I've played darts plenty of times, so I know what I'm doing.": "",
  "For crying out loud... You got me with that one.": "",
  "Shall we have a little competition?": "",
  "Sure. Sounds fun.": "",
  "How about we play some darts again?": "",
  "Very well. Do not hold back...": "",
  "All right! I won!": "",
  "You truly have impeccable aim... and control.": "",
  "Heh. Damn straight I do.": "",
  "Tch. I guess it's a tie.": "",
  "That was certainly intense...": "",
  "Dang! I can't believe I lost!": "",
  "Fwahaha. I like that frustrated expression. Looks good on you.": "",
  "Graghhh... My stomach... It huuurts...": "",
  "Now pay what you owe and get outta here.": "",
  "I-I don't wanna! I'm not movin' till I get a mountain of food on my plate!": "",
  "You know you're gonna get punished by the food god, right?": "",
  "Now! Make your decision: Atone for your sins by paying what you owe, or prepare to face the netherworld!": "",
  "It... looks like...": "",
  "Yagami-san. Fortune teller lady. Thank you for driving away that thief.": "",
  "But... could this mean that my cow calamity is gone?": "",
  "(Should I invite Tsumugi-san out? ...Maybe now's not such a good time.)": "",
  "Did I keep you waiting?": "",
  "Oh no, I just got here myself.": "",
  "(Should I give Tsumugi-san a present?)": "",
  "So I actually have something for you...": "",
  "Oh, is this for me?": "",
  "Yeah. I thought it'd look good on you.": "",
  "Wow! It looks so... refined! I love it!": "",
  "It seemed like it would match your tastes.": "",
  "Absolutely, I love this sort of thing. Thank you!": "",
  "I'll try this on right away.": "",
  "Yeah. Can't wait to see you in it.": "",
  "Well? I don't look strange at all?": "",
  "Nope. In fact, you look great!": "",
  "*chuckle* That makes me happy.": "",
  "Hey, Tsumugi-san. I got you something.": "",
  "My goodness! Was this not in your budget?": "",
  "Well, I admit I splurged a little.": "",
  "I feel bad now.": "",
  "Don't go pawning it off somewhere, okay?": "",
  "Of course I wouldn't... as long as my finances are stable.": "",
  "(Damn, I think I scared her off. Maybe it was too expensive?)": "",
  "You did? Are you sure? My, thank you so much.": "",
  "Sure thing. Check this out.": "",
  "O-Oh...": "",
  "Truthfully speaking, I doubt I'd look good in it. It's a bit too stylish for me.": "",
  "Hmm, I wonder.": "",
  "Well, maybe try it on sometime.": "",
  "I will consider it.": "",
  "(Maybe I should choose something more appropriate next time...)": "",
  "Oh my! Are you sure this is okay?": "",
  "Of course. Now check this out...": "",
  "This is beautiful! I promise to take good care of it!": "",
  "(That seemed to go pretty well. I'm glad she's happy.)": "",
  "Takayuki-san. Where shall we go today?": "",
  "(What should we do...)": "",
  "How about the casino? Spend some cash, blow off some steam...": "",
  "How very eloquent of you. *chuckle* Sounds like a pleasant date to me.": "",
  "Great. Then let's go.": "",
  "Very well. Challenge accepted.": "",
  "Wanna go play shogi?": "",
  "Very well. Prepare yourself.": "",
  "You showed me a wonderful time today, Takayuki-san. Thank you.": "",
  "Yeah, I had a good time too. Thanks for coming with.": "",
  "Invite me out again sometime, okay? Until then... I'll be thinking of you.": "",
  "(Tsumugi-san has this amazing energy about her... it's infectious in a good way.)": "",
  "I'm impressed, Takayuki-san. I'm usually quite dominant on the shogi board.": "",
  "*chuckle* I'm usually quite dominant on the shogi board.": "",
  "Let's play some darts, Tsumugi-san.": "",
  "Very well... Hold nothing back from me!": "",
  "You truly don't hold back, do you?": "",
  "Nope. That's my policy, after all.": "",
  "*chuckle* It's interesting to know you have such a competitive side.": "",
  "Splendid! That was quite a thrilling match, don't you think?": "",
  "I do. You've really improved, Tsumugi-san.": "",
  "So you've noticed. I'm glad I practiced, then.": "",
  "Oh? Is the game over already?": "",
  "Not bad, Tsumugi-san.": "",
  "*chuckle* Perhaps fate was on my side today.": "",
  "(I'll win for sure next time...)": "",
  "Well? Do you see anything? Can you tell when someone's about to lose?": "",
  "No, my powers don't exactly work like that...": "",
  "Mm. I guess that would make you pretty overpowered.": "",
  "Well, let's just have fun anyway.": "",
  "Hmm... What's something we would both enjoy... I guess poker would be our best bet.": "",
  "Poker... That does sound interesting, but I'm not too clear on the rules.": "",
  "Then I'll be happy to teach you.": "",
  "Do you want to play poker again?": "",
  "Why not. It can be quite entertaining to put our fate in the hands of the cards.": "",
  "I'll provide the betting money, so play to your heart's content.": "",
  "I apologize for making you pay for me each time.": "",
  "It's not a problem. Just don't hold back once the game starts, okay?": "",
  "I feel like there's no need to... I doubt I could defeat you in the first place!": "",
  "Very impressive, Yagami-san. I had no idea your luck sign was so strong...": "",
  "I'd say it's more pluck than luck... and maybe a little bit of bluffing.": "",
  "Looks like fortune is on my side.": "",
  "Of course it is. You're a fortune teller.": "",
  "*chuckle* Looks like fate smiles upon me again.": "",
  "Damn. I guess we both lost.": "",
  "As fate would have it.": "",
  "Takayuki-san, that was amazing!": "",
  "No one stands a chance against you even in gambling!": "",
  "Oh? Did I win?": "",
  "Whoa, way to go Tsumugi-san!": "",
  "\"Fortune favors the bold.\" Or so the saying goes.": "",
  "Dang. Neither of us could pull it off.": "",
  "It would seem that luck wasn't on our side today.": "",
  "(Oh, should I buy a present for Amane-san before our date?)": "",
  "(Doesn't seem like she has anything more to say.)": "",
  "(Well. I guess I'll wait till Amane-san gets here.)": "",
  "Don't mean to barge in on ya, but...": "",
  "Hmph. You'll have to excuse my abruptness, but I need to speak with you for a moment.": "",
  "...Is this work-related? Did you set up an appointment?": "",
  "No, I didn't feel that was necessary. I noticed you from outside, so I thought I'd come in for a quick chat.": "",
  "(...Wait. I think I know this guy.)": "",
  "(That's Amane-san's patron, if I'm not mistaken...)": "",
  "What, is this a bad time?": "",
  "Well. I do have some very important matters to attend to.": "",
  "Then I'll make this as quick and painless as possible...": "",
  "Provided you take a moment to clean out your ears and listen.": "",
  "Fine. What do you want?": "",
  "First off, let me introduce myself. I'm Takero Ushimata, also known as the Obstinate Ox of Kamurocho.": "",
  "(...Unless I'm totally mistaken, an ox is pretty much a cow. Right?)": "",
  "Um. This might sound irrelevant, but would you happen to have a cow tattoo on your back?": "",
  "Oh, yeah, I do. It's a magnificent one, in fact.": "",
  "Haha... Of course you would...": "",
  "Anyway. What do you want with me?": "",
  "You need to stop seeing Amane-san.": "",
  "We're currently engaged in a minor scuffle, you see. Yet my men have suffered countless setbacks and injuries.": "",
  "Now Amane-san's abilities have certainly helped us a great deal...": "",
  "But since she hasn't been able to see anything lately, we've been experiencing quite a bit of trouble.": "",
  "I'm aware of that. Now why do you want to keep me away from her?": "",
  "Didn't she tell you? About how she can't give readings whenever she's deeply concerned?": "",
  "Yeah, she did. But she doesn't seem to know what the root of it is, though.": "",
  "Well, I would think it's fairly obvious.": "",
  "It's you, buddy.": "",
  "That girl's started falling for you, but she just don't realize it yet. That's what's got her thrown for a loop.": "",
  "...No, that can't be it...": "",
  "I need her to get her powers back immediately. Otherwise we might not have a future left to read.": "",
  "And while I understand she's having love issues, this is a matter of life and death. At least to us.": "",
  "So could you, uh, stop seeing her from now on?": "",
  "We'll pay you, of course. Two million yen. I have it all in cash.": "",
  "(...Wait. Should I really be doing this? Taking a bribe from a yakuza...)": "",
  "Heh. Need some time to mull it over?": "",
  "...No, there's no need for that.": "",
  "So what's your answer?": "",
  "I understand the conditions. But unfortunately for you, I can't agree to those terms.": "",
  "...Oh?": "",
  "Now if that's all, I'd like you to leave.": "",
  "(What!?)": "",
  "You know. I'm not sure if you caught the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>subtext</font_kind>, but this is an offer you can't refuse.": "",
  "Considering how many lives are on the line... I won't be holding back.": "",
  "Now say goodbye to Amane-san for good!": "",
  "Ugh.": "",
  "A... Amane-san...": "",
  "What happened to you!?": "",
  "Why are you all...": "",
  "Let's just say your patron has a problem with me.": "",
  "He thinks I'm making you lose your powers.": "",
  "Yeah. He's saying I'm the major obstacle that's blocking your third eye.": "",
  "And apparently this guy Ushimata? He's nicknamed after a freaking cow!": "",
  "...I am aware of that.": "",
  "Then... you mind if we talk for a bit?": "",
  "Amane-san, you knew about the patriarch's name this whole time, didn't you?": "",
  "I did. And I apologize.": "",
  "Did it never cross your mind that he could be the cow calamity?": "",
  "Actually, I had been considering that...": "",
  "And I came to such a conclusion fairly early on.": "",
  "Then...": "",
  "I wanted to, but...": "",
  "Don't worry. I get it.": "",
  "This is your first regular, after all.": "",
  "You couldn't risk losing such an important customer over some calamity that couldn't even be verified.": "",
  "That's not it!": "",
  "Well, it is true that I wanted to take good care of my very first patron...": "",
  "However... if he truly is the cow calamity...": "",
  "Then it means I was the one who brought this disaster into your life.": "",
  "Well, when you put it like that...": "",
  "That's why as long as you and I continue to meet, the calamity will never go away.": "",
  "If anything, it'll grow even worse. The closer we get, the more dangerous your situation will be.": "",
  "So that's why you kept saying the calamity was getting bigger...": "",
  "But I didn't want to admit that. I just... couldn't.": "",
  "Before I knew it, you'd... become such a huge part of my life.": "",
  "I want to keep seeing you. Truly, I do. But... doing so will only bring you more misfortune.": "",
  "That... is the source of my troubles. And thus, the reason my power has dwindled down to nothing.": "",
  "I had no idea.": "",
  "...I'm so sorry, Yagami-san.": "",
  "It turns out the real calamity...": "",
  "...Was me.": "",
  "Please excuse me. I'll be heading home now.": "",
  "We should probably stop seeing each other... for good.": "",
  "You can't be serious...": "",
  "(Am I really going to let it end like this?)": "",
  "(I know. Maybe I'll give Amane-san a gift?)": "",
  "Oh? You actually went out and bought something?": "",
  "Yeah... I thought it'd look good on you.": "",
  "I bet you'd look really good in it.": "",
  "Amane-san. I have something for you.": "",
  "You do? Are you sure? My, thank you so much.": "",
  "By the way, that guy who hired you sounds pretty well off. What's he do for a living?": "",
  "Well... that would be...": "",
  "...A business secret.": "",
  "Now I wanna know even more...": "",
  "Then why don't we go have some fun?": "",
  "Please dispense with that.": "",
  "With what?": "",
  "Amane is my last name.": "",
  "Ohh. Okay. Got it.": "",
  "Then, let's be together, Tsumugi-san. Always.": "",
  "Yes. I'd like that... Takayuki-san.": "",
  "Ahaha... Then I'll be sure to keep an eye out.": "",
  "Could he be...": "",
  "Did you feel this was necessary for me to do my job?": "",
  "C'mon, it looks great on you, so why worry about it?": "",
  "What sort of logic is that...?": "",
  "I had a feeling you'd look good in a kimono, Tsumugi-san.": "",
  "People were staring and moving out of my way on the street...": "",
  "Maybe they thought you were a yakuza's wife. Haha. Or who knows, maybe they were just totally captivated by your beauty.": "",
  "*sigh* Somehow I doubt it.": "",
  "I actually have a present for you, Tsumugi-san.": "",
  "Huh!? A kimono?": "",
  "I saw it and I said, wow, that would be perfect for you, so I bought it on the spot. What do you say you give it a shot next time we meet up?": "",
  "I was not expecting a gift, so I'm happy. Although...": "",
  "If I walk around Kamurocho wearing this, won't people assume I'm some kind of yakuza wife?": "",
  "Ha, maybe, but on the plus side, nobody's gonna bother you at least.": "",
  "I actually have a present for you, Amane-san.": "",
  "Here, it's a kimono. I thought it would fit your image.": "",
  "Thank you! I'm happy, but...": "",
  "If I walk next to you wearing this, won't I look like a yakuza wife?": "",
  "Hey, who would take one look at me and think I'm yakuza? Besides, it's only punks who give anyone any trouble out there.": "",
  "It wouldn't be so far-fetched that I would be a yakuza wife under the escort of the family muscle... But that might be fun.": "",
  "I will try wearing it next time we meet.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. Did I keep you waiting?": "",
  "Nah, you're totally fine. You said you wanted to take me out somewhere?": "",
  "That's right. It's the least I could do for someone who saved my life.": "",
  "Eh, it woulda felt weird to show up empty-handed.": "",
  "Why don't we go unwind somewhere for a bit? That way we can work up an appetite.": "",
  "Anywhere you want to go?": "",
  "Oh, I know! How about we check out the drone races?": "",
  "I've been researching drones for one of my projects at work, and before I knew it, I found myself totally hooked.": "",
  "Oh yeah? I have a drone, if you're interested. I've even been in a few races.": "",
  "Wow, you're into drones too? I never would've guessed!": "",
  "I can only imagine how exciting a race can be...": "",
  "Is that the only thing you wanted to do?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "O-Oh...": "อ๋อ...",
  "...Oh?": "...โอ้?",
  "(What!?)": "(อะไรนะ!?)",
  "Ugh.": "โอ๊ย...",
  "Then...": "แล้ว...",
  "I had no idea.": "ไม่เคยรู้เลย",
  "You can't be serious...": "ไม่เอาน่า จริงจังรึเปล่าเนี่ย...",
  "With what?": "ด้วยอะไรเหรอ?"
 }
}
